#  2: Background and Problem

## Background

Recruitment is one of the most important business activities in every organization. Employers need an efficient way to advertise vacancies, receive applications, evaluate candidates, and hire qualified employees.

## Problem Statement

Many organizations still use manual recruitment methods such as emails, paper applications, and spreadsheets. These methods often lead to:

- Lost or duplicated applications
- Slow recruitment process
- Difficult applicant tracking
- Poor record management
- Limited reporting capabilities

The proposed system will centralize recruitment information in an Oracle database to improve efficiency and data management.

