#  7: Proposed Solution and Innovation

## Proposed Solution

The system will provide:

- Employer Registration
- Applicant Registration
- Job Posting
- Online Job Applications
- Interview Scheduling
- Recruitment Reports

## Planned Innovation

An Oracle APEX web application will be connected directly to the Oracle database, allowing employers and applicants to interact with the system through a user-friendly interface while PL/SQL procedures enforce business rules.

---

#  8: Planned Database Design

## Planned Tables

- Users
- Employers
- Applicants
- Jobs
- Applications
- Interviews
- Skills
- Applicant_Skills
- Departments
- Notifications
- Audit_Log

## Relationship Overview

Employer → Jobs → Applications → Applicants → Interviews

Primary keys and foreign keys will maintain relationships and ensure data integrity.

---

#  9: Planned PL/SQL Features

| Feature            | Purpose                                              |
| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| Procedures         | Register employers, applicants, and jobs             |
| Functions          | Count applications and check job availability        |
| Cursors            | Display applicant information and generate reports   |
| Triggers           | Prevent late applications and maintain audit records |
| Packages           | Organize recruitment procedures and functions        |
| Exception Handling | Handle duplicate applications and invalid records    |

